@startuml state_machine_pipeline
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam StateBorderColor #555555
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #EBF5FB
skinparam ArrowColor #333333

title State Machine — AI Pipeline (Document Processing)

[*] --> QUEUED : Upload tài liệu\n(API Service enqueue job)

state QUEUED : File đã lưu vào MinIO\nJob đã đưa vào Redis queue

state fork_input <<choice>>
QUEUED --> fork_input : Worker nhận job

fork_input --> TRANSCRIBING : Video / Audio input
fork_input --> PARSING : Text input\n(PDF / DOCX / PPTX)

state TRANSCRIBING : Whisper API\nconvert audio → transcript
TRANSCRIBING --> PARSING : Transcription done
TRANSCRIBING --> ERROR : Whisper failed

state PARSING : Trích xuất text + heading\ntừ raw document
PARSING --> CHUNKING : Parsed OK
PARSING --> ERROR : Parse failed

state CHUNKING : Phân đoạn văn bản\ntheo heading structure\n(sliding window nếu dài)
CHUNKING --> EMBEDDING : Chunks created
CHUNKING --> ERROR : Chunk failed

state EMBEDDING : Tạo vector 1024 chiều (BGE-M3)\nUpsert vào Qdrant\nInsert chunk metadata vào PostgreSQL
EMBEDDING --> EXTRACTING : Embeddings done
EMBEDDING --> ERROR : Embed / upsert failed

state EXTRACTING : Trích xuất Concept\nspaCy NER (candidates)\n+ LLM (refine + category + prerequisites)\nCanonicalize → INSERT concepts, chunk_concepts\nEmit outbox event
EXTRACTING --> GRAPHING : Concepts extracted
EXTRACTING --> ERROR : Extraction failed

state GRAPHING : Outbox worker projects sang Neo4j\nMERGE Heading graph\nMERGE Concept graph\n([:MENTIONS] [:PREREQUISITE_OF] [:RELATED_TO])
GRAPHING --> GENERATING : Graph projected
GRAPHING --> ERROR : Neo4j write failed\n(retry via outbox)

state GENERATING : Gọi LLM (OpenAI/Gemini)\nSinh Summary (3–5 ý chính)\n+ Quiz (5–10 câu MCQ, Bloom taxonomy)
GENERATING --> CLIPPING : Video input
GENERATING --> DONE : Text input
GENERATING --> ERROR : LLM failed\n(retry ≤ 3 lần, exp. backoff)

state CLIPPING : FFmpeg cắt video\nthành clip ngắn (1–5 phút)\ntheo timestamp ý chính
CLIPPING --> DONE : Clips saved to MinIO
CLIPPING --> ERROR : FFmpeg failed

state DONE : Pipeline hoàn tất\nCards + Quiz đã sẵn sàng\nFrontend nhận notification
DONE --> [*]

state ERROR : Ghi error_msg\n+ last_success_state\nHiển thị nút "Retry"
ERROR --> QUEUED : Manual retry\n(resume từ last_success_state)

note right of EXTRACTING
  Stage 1 — spaCy NER:
    nhanh, local, low confidence
  Stage 2 — LLM (GPT-4o-mini):
    chỉ trigger chunk > 200 tokens
    output: {name, category, prerequisites[]}
  Stage 3 — Canonicalize:
    fuzzy match → canonical_name
    source: "llm" | "order" | "manual"
end note

note right of GENERATING
  Model Tiering:
  - GPT-4o-mini: Summary (đơn giản)
  - GPT-4o: Quiz bậc cao (Bloom)
end note

note right of ERROR
  Auto-retry: tối đa 3 lần
  Backoff: 1s → 2s → 4s
  Sau đó: status = ERROR
end note

@enduml
